---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Stop checking five different systems to figure out what's going on"
  description="OwnerOS helps you run your business from one place, while ERP Intelligence gives distributors a live view of inventory, purchasing, and operations."
>
  <section class="hero-section">
    <div class="wrap text-center">
      <span class="kicker">For owner-led firms and distributors</span>
      <h1 class="hero-title">Stop checking five different systems to figure out what's going on.</h1>
      <p class="hero-subtitle">OwnerOS helps you run your business from one place, while ERP Intelligence gives distributors a live view of inventory, purchasing, and operations.</p>
      <div class="hero-buttons">
        <a href="https://links.zenprocess.ai/widget/booking/rcoKJifJJA46bRI9fTEr" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-primary">Book a call</a>
        <a href="/case-study" class="btn btn-ghost">See the work</a>
      </div>
      <p class="hero-eyebrow">Led by Vinh Truong · 20+ yrs VP/CTO · $80M+ initiatives · CISSP</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-doors reveal">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="kicker text-center">Which are you?</p>
      <div class="doors">
        <div class="door owner">
          <h3>OwnerOS</h3>
          <p class="eyebrow door-kicker">For owners and small teams</p>
          <p class="door-desc">One screen that shows what's late, what's stuck, and what needs you. It reads your CRM, books, inbox, and calendar, then drafts the follow-up. You approve it. Nothing goes out on its own.</p>
          <a href="/owner-os" class="arrow">Explore OwnerOS &rarr;</a>
        </div>
        <div class="door">
          <h3>ERP Intelligence</h3>
          <p class="eyebrow door-kicker">For multi-warehouse distributors</p>
          <p class="door-desc">Live dashboards and exception alerts on top of your ERP. A national building materials distributor: 3,000+ SKUs, 800+ daily exceptions flagged, 0% variance versus SAP, 16 weeks from audit to daily use.</p>
          <a href="/for-distributors" class="arrow">See the distributor track &rarr;</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-stats reveal">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="stats">
        <div><div class="n">20+ yrs</div><div class="eyebrow">Enterprise IT & CTO</div></div>
        <div><div class="n">$80M+</div><div class="eyebrow">initiatives delivered</div></div>
        <div><div class="n">Production</div><div class="eyebrow">grade, not demos</div></div>
        <div><div class="n">Houston, TX</div><div class="eyebrow">Founder-led</div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-final-cta reveal text-center">
    <div class="wrap final-cta-wrap">
      <h2 class="final-cta-title">Tell me what is slipping. I will tell you if we can help.</h2>
      <p class="final-cta-desc">A 30-minute call, no pitch deck. We look at how you run today and whether this is worth it for you.</p>
      <a href="https://links.zenprocess.ai/widget/booking/rcoKJifJJA46bRI9fTEr" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-primary">Book a call</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .hero-section {
    background: var(--hero-glow);
    padding-top: 110px;
    padding-bottom: 64px;
  }
  .hero-title {
    font-size: clamp(36px, 5.4vw, 62px);
    font-weight: 800;
    margin: 18px auto 20px;
    max-width: 820px;
  }
  .hero-subtitle {
    font-size: clamp(18px, 2vw, 21px);
    color: var(--ink-2);
    max-width: 680px;
    margin: 0 auto 30px;
  }
  .hero-buttons {
    display: flex;
    gap: 14px;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .hero-eyebrow {
    margin-top: 26px;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  .section-doors {
    padding-top: 20px;
  }
  .section-doors .kicker {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 26px;
  }
  .door-kicker {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--ink-2);
  }
  .door-desc {
    margin-top: 14px;
    color: var(--ink-2);
  }
  .section-stats {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .section-final-cta {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .final-cta-wrap {
    max-width: 640px;
  }
  .final-cta-title {
    font-size: clamp(30px, 4vw, 44px);
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .final-cta-desc {
    color: var(--ink-2);
    margin-bottom: 28px;
  }
</style>
